0	79	Maria Damanaki (Greek: Μαρία Δαμανάκη; born 31 May 1952) is a Greek politician.
80	244	She is a former president of the Synaspismos party of the left and former state member of the Hellenic Parliament within the Panhellenic Socialist Movement (PASOK).
245	325	She served as the Global Managing Director for Oceans at The Nature Conservancy.
